## Active Hooks (enforced automatically)
- branch-guard: blocks push to main/master
- block-env-edit: prevents editing .env files
- pre-commit: validates before commits
- auto-format: formats on file write
- pre-compact: saves context before compaction
- session-context-loader: restores context on session start
- confirm-delete: confirms rm -rf
- migration-validate: validates before supabase db push
- pre-deploy-gate: checks before vercel --prod

## Top Learned Rules
- ALWAYS check `pwd` and read local CLAUDE.md on session start
- ALWAYS use feature branches — branch-guard blocks main pushes
- NEVER expose service_role key in client components
- NEVER use Task(Explore) for simple lookups — use Glob/Grep directly
- ALWAYS run post-deploy verification (HTTP 200, auth, console, latency)
- sigatalachana = Python agent (NOT web)
- armenius = Cloudflare Workers (NOT Vercel)

